00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,400
大家都很尊敬她
Lot of respect for that girl.

186
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:31,040
那屋子里可是满怀爱意
Lot of love in the room.

187
00:09:31,450 --> 00:09:33,830
而且布道 布道也很不错
And the spread. What a spread.

188
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,190
真的是很好
Just really nice.

189
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:38,390
那完全无法传达
That does not begin to convey

190
00:09:39,500 --> 00:09:41,000
真是的 也许其他台有电影在播
Aw, geez. Maybe there's a movie on.

191
00:09:41,020 --> 00:09:43,230
- 我们可以换台 - 别换 就看这个
- No, we can switch it. - No, keep it. Keep it.

192
00:09:43,470 --> 00:09:44,550
真是一场遗憾的悲剧
Awful, tragic loss.

193
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:51,400
我向罗宾·沃德的家人表达深切的哀悼
My deepest condolences to Robin Ward's family.

194
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:54,550
我当时正在追逐银行劫匪
I was chasing these bank robbers.

195
00:09:54,610 --> 00:09:56,710
此时她很不巧地走在马路中间
She just stepped in the middle of the street,

196
00:09:56,760 --> 00:09:58,540
而我 我没办法...
and I-I couldn't...

197
00:09:58,640 --> 00:10:00,290
路中间...
Middle of the...

198
00:10:00,290 --> 00:10:02,660
她明明离人行道只有半步远
She was a half step off the fucking curb.

199
00:10:02,670 --> 00:10:03,740
别这样 休伊
Oh, now, come on, Hughie.

200
00:10:03,750 --> 00:10:06,470
别生气 好吗
Just, uh, don't get upset, okay? Just...

201
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:08,000
他自己心里知道
He knows.

202
00:10:14,660 --> 00:10:17,240
沃特公司的每个人都...
Everyone at Vought is just...

203
00:10:17,260 --> 00:10:19,820
为罗宾感到难过
just wrecked about Robin.

204
00:10:19,850 --> 00:10:24,100
但是听着 你俩还没有结婚
Now, you two weren't married, and look,

205
00:10:24,270 --> 00:10:27,130
严格来说 你并没有索赔权
technically, there's no legal claim.

206
00:10:27,150 --> 00:10:30,010
但是沃特公司想做正确的事
But Vought wants to do the right thing:

207
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:34,330
那就是为你提供四万五千美元的赔偿
Offer you $45,000 in restitution.

208
00:10:35,110 --> 00:10:37,360
你只需要在这里
All you have to do is sign

209
00:10:37,390 --> 00:10:38,540
签字就行了
right here,

210
00:10:39,010 --> 00:10:40,740
然后我把支票给你
and I'll offer you the check.

211
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:45,540
这是一份保密协议
This is a confidentiality agreement.

212
00:10:45,540 --> 00:10:47,740
只是一个常规条款
It's a boilerplate nda.

213
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:50,300
我签了这个 然后
I sign this, and...

214
00:10:50,830 --> 00:10:52,580
我就再也不能说起这件事了
I can't talk about it?

215
00:10:53,700 --> 00:10:55,050
就得假装无事发生吗
Have to pretend like it didn't happen,

216
00:10:55,060 --> 00:10:58,300
就好像我从未握着罗宾的断手一样
like I wasn't holding Robin's arms in my hands?

217
00:10:58,340 --> 00:11:00,190
听着 我知道你很生气
Look, I know you're upset,

218
00:11:00,210 --> 00:11:02,550
但我们只是想帮忙
but we're just trying to help.

219
00:11:03,020 --> 00:11:04,620
那你们倒是说你们很抱歉啊
Then say you're sorry.

220
00:11:05,170 --> 00:11:06,520
什么
Excuse me?

221
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:08,910
你们这些人表面上说 "我们的哀悼"
I mean, you people say "Our condolences"

222
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:10,970
"我很同情" 或是 "我们很遗憾"
and "My sympathies" And "Our regrets,"

223
00:11:10,980 --> 00:11:13,020
但没有一个人敢看着我的双眼
but nobody can look me in the fucking eye

224
00:11:13,020 --> 00:11:15,860
对我说"抱歉"
and say "I'm sorry."

225
00:11:16,330 --> 00:11:18,660
我什么都不会签的 给我滚出去
I'm not signing anything. Get out.

226
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:23,160
我说 你给我滚出去
I said get the hell out!

227
00:11:28,740 --> 00:11:30,120
你还好吗
You okay?

228
00:11:32,100 --> 00:11:35,970
如我所说 这真的只是个常规条款
As I said, boilerplate nda, really.

229
00:11:35,970 --> 00:11:37,580
流程化的东西而已
Pretty standard stuff.

230
00:11:38,260 --> 00:11:39,700
我能考虑一下吗
Can I think about it?

231
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:47,090
如果你有任何疑问 就...
If you have any questions at all, just, uh...

232
00:11:54,860 --> 00:11:56,220
44编队 代号20
Unit 44, code 20.

233
00:11:56,230 --> 00:11:59,190
地址是142063路
Address is 142063rd street...

234
00:12:02,340 --> 00:12:04,480
有疯子在外面闹事吗
Any maniacs out there?

235
00:12:04,530 --> 00:12:06,060
没有 平静的夜晚
Mm-mm. Quiet night.

236
00:12:06,110 --> 00:12:07,670
夜夜皆是如此
Like every night.

237
00:12:07,990 --> 00:12:08,940
太倒霉了
That's too bad.

238
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:11,880
我们真的急需炒作的机会
We could really use the press right now.

239
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:15,160
安妮
Oh, Annie.

240
00:12:15,180 --> 00:12:16,740
我饿了
I'm hungry.

241
00:12:17,220 --> 00:12:19,090
别担心 我拿不到那个工作的
Don't worry. I didn't get the job.

242
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:21,220
那可不一定
You don't know that.

243
00:12:21,220 --> 00:12:24,520
他们在全国面试女孩
They're auditioning girls nationwide.

244
00:12:24,570 --> 00:12:26,120
估计是女伯爵被录用了
Besides, Countess probably got it.

245
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,900
她的面试表现很好
She's so good in a room.

246
00:12:27,910 --> 00:12:32,040
如果你消极的话 消极的事便会发生
If you're negative, negative things happen to you.

247
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:33,990
您好
Hello?

248
00:12:34,010 --> 00:12:35,830
是的 我是她妈妈
Yes, I'm her mother.

249
00:12:37,410 --> 00:12:38,730
好的
Uh, yes. Uh...

250
00:12:39,020 --> 00:12:40,730
请稍等
Uh, one moment.

251
00:12:41,760 --> 00:12:42,740
是他们
It's them.

252
00:12:42,750 --> 00:12:43,940
是他们
It's them.

253
00:12:44,660 --> 00:12:45,740
您好
Hello?

254
00:12:46,950 --> 00:12:48,740
是的 我就是
Yes, this is she.

255
00:12:52,330 --> 00:12:53,140
我被录用了
I got it?

256
00:12:53,180 --> 00:12:55,890
你被录用了 你被录用了
You got it! You got it!

257
00:12:58,800 --> 00:12:59,840
我的天啊
Oh, my god.

258
00:12:59,880 --> 00:13:01,830
对不起 对不起
Uh, I'm so... I'm so sorry.

259
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:03,830
刚才信号不好
It's a weird connection.

260
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:05,420
我也不知道发生了什么
I don't know what that was, actually.

261
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:09,480
妈的
Oh, shit.

262
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:11,420
是吗
Yeah?

263
00:13:11,420 --> 00:13:12,770
我认为她在吸毒
I think she was an addict.

264
00:13:13,340 --> 00:13:14,420
有针孔吗
Needle tracks?

265
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:15,950
一只胳膊上有12个针孔
12 marks on one arm.

266
00:13:16,450 --> 00:13:18,240
源源不断的毒品被运入
More dope coming in.

267
00:13:19,130 --> 00:13:20,980
源源不断的毒贩开始工作
More pushers at work.

268
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:22,250
你在干嘛
What you doing?

269
00:13:22,780 --> 00:13:24,480
我不能以刑事案件起诉火车头
Can't file a criminal case against A-train

270
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,430
超级英雄就像警察一样
Supes are like cops.

271
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:26,660
他们受法律保护
They can't be charged

272
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:28,540
- 不会因工作时造成的伤亡而被起诉 - 好吧
- for damages while they're on the job. - Okay.

273
00:13:28,540 --> 00:13:30,380
但兴许我们可以把罪名改为疏忽致死
But maybe we can file a wrongful death.

274
00:13:30,390 --> 00:13:34,220
- 我需要让罗宾的父母签字 - 休伊
- I just got to get Robin's parents to sign off on it. - Hughie,

275
00:13:34,790 --> 00:13:37,670
- 过来陪我坐会 - 爸爸 我正在...
- come sit with me. - Dad, I'm right...

276
00:13:38,810 --> 00:13:40,020
好吧
Okay.

277
00:13:47,430 --> 00:13:48,760
好孩子
Good for you.

278
00:13:49,510 --> 00:13:52,520
你想为罗宾声张正义
You want to make this right, what happened to Robin.

279
00:13:55,180 --> 00:13:56,800
但你无能为力
But you can't.

280
00:13:57,910 --> 00:13:59,470
签了它吧
So sign this.

281
00:14:01,490 --> 00:14:02,580
什么
What?

282
00:14:02,700 --> 00:14:04,640
这可是一大笔钱 休伊
This is a lot of money, Hughie.

283
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,360
我们需要这笔钱
We could really use it.

284
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:11,360
不行 爸爸 他们杀了她
I can't... dad, they killed her.

285
00:14:11,370 --> 00:14:12,820
你现实点行不行
Be realistic, okay?

286
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:14,640
就算我们能付得起律师费...
Even if we could pay for a lawyer...

287
00:14:14,650 --> 00:14:17,170
事实上我们不行 我们没法起诉
And that's a big if... There's no case.

288
00:14:17,210 --> 00:14:18,100
她当时在街上
She was in the street.

289
00:14:18,140 --> 00:14:20,730
就像公交车撞了她一样
Be like if a bus hit her.

290
00:14:20,770 --> 00:14:21,940
爸爸 她离人行道只有一步之遥
Dad, she was one step off the curb.

291
00:14:22,060 --> 00:14:23,920
- 我亲眼所见 - 休伊 听我说
- I saw it! - Hughie, look. Look.

292
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:26,490
- 你无能为力 - 为什么
- You can't do this. - Why not?

293
00:14:26,530 --> 00:14:28,110
- 爸爸 我有... - 你没有斗志
- Dad, I have... - You don't have the fight.

294
00:14:28,210 --> 00:14:29,790
从来都没有过
You never have.

295
00:14:34,280 --> 00:14:36,180
对不起 但这是事实
I'm sorry, but it's-it's true.

296
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:39,210
我也一样
Neither do I.

297
00:14:41,900 --> 00:14:42,860
现在
Now...

298
00:14:44,060 --> 00:14:46,420
过来陪我坐会 好吗
Come and... come and sit with me, okay?

299
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:48,560
正在播《斯蒂尔传奇》呢
Remington Steele's on.

300
00:14:49,430 --> 00:14:51,790
休伊 你去哪
Hughie! Where you going?

301
00:14:58,880 --> 00:15:01,750
沃特总公司门外铺上了红地毯
The red carpet outside of Vought headquarters,

302
00:15:01,750 --> 00:15:04,090
即将开始年度股东大会
here for the annual shareholders presentation...

303
00:15:06,330 --> 00:15:07,620
她来了
There she is.

304
00:15:07,630 --> 00:15:09,170
欢迎来到纽约
Welcome to New York.

305
00:15:09,190 --> 00:15:11,690
我是艾希莉·巴雷特 人力资源总管
I'm Ashley Barrett, director of talent relations.

306
00:15:11,730 --> 00:15:14,400
这些人都是为我而来吗
So, uh, are all these people here for me?

307
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,440
亲爱的
Oh, honey.

308
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:18,300
他们还能为谁而来呢
Who else would they be here for?

309
00:15:18,730 --> 00:15:19,230
来吧
Come on.

310
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:20,200
我们要迟到了
We're running late.

311
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:21,830
我的天啊
Oh, my god.

312
00:15:29,040 --> 00:15:30,400
女士们先生们
Ladies and gentlemen,

313
00:15:30,750 --> 00:15:33,690
毫无疑问 如今是超级英雄产业的
it is without a doubt a good time

314
00:15:33,700 --> 00:15:35,910
黄金时期
to be in the superhero business.

315
00:15:36,890 --> 00:15:39,970
我们的净利润提高了百分之14
Our net income is up 14%.

316
00:15:40,030 --> 00:15:43,500
我们最新的电影《G战警之世界大战》
Our latest film, G-men: World war,

317
00:15:43,600 --> 00:15:45,120
在全球取得了
just grossed shy

318
00:15:45,140 --> 00:15:48,690
17亿美元的票房
of $1.7 billion world-wide.

319
00:15:48,770 --> 00:15:50,300
今年秋天 我们最新的主题公园
And this fall, we break ground

320
00:15:50,310 --> 00:15:52,900
将在巴黎城郊破土动工
on our newest theme park outside of Paris.

321
00:15:53,010 --> 00:15:56,200
本公司的品牌机遇数不胜数
The branding opportunities are limitless.

322
00:15:58,080 --> 00:16:01,290
但是 你们知道 这些都不重要
But, you know, none of that really matters.

323
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:06,890
因为我们的主要工作是 管理 支持
Because job one is managing, supporting,

324
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:10,200
并给勇敢的英雄们提供建议
and advising the brave heroes

325
00:16:10,390 --> 00:16:14,700
他们每天都置自身于险境中
who put themselves in harm's way each and every day

326
00:16:14,890 --> 00:16:15,890
只为我们的安危
for us.

327
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,290
让我们来看看吧
Let's take a look.

328
00:16:24,820 --> 00:16:27,290
一个没有犯罪的世界
A world without crime,

329
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:30,000
所有人尽享自由与正义
with liberty and justice for all,

330
00:16:30,410 --> 00:16:32,100
多亏了沃特大家族的
that's within our reach,

331
00:16:32,280 --> 00:16:35,290
200多名超级英雄
thanks to the 200-plus superheroes

332
00:16:35,310 --> 00:16:37,100
让这一切都近在眼前
in the vought family.

333
00:16:37,280 --> 00:16:39,460
我们能看见美好的未来
We see a bright future ahead,

334
00:16:39,490 --> 00:16:43,510
现在每一个城镇里都有一个沃特公司的英雄
where there is a Vought hero in every town.

335
00:16:44,120 --> 00:16:46,510
对了 迄今为止你表现很好
You're doing really well, by the way, so far.

336
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:49,210
可我还什么也没做
I-I haven't done anything yet.

337
00:16:49,330 --> 00:16:51,980
正是如此 你在18岁到49岁的中西部居民及保守天主教徒中
Yeah, exactly. You're already up two-and-a-half points with midwesterners

338
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,900
支持率已经上升了2.5%
and conservative christians in 18 to 49.

339
00:16:54,330 --> 00:16:56,700
顺便说一下 你试镜时讲的那段话
That speech, by the way, your audition...

340
00:16:57,780 --> 00:16:59,710
很谦虚 很谦虚
It was modest... It was humble.

341
00:16:59,740 --> 00:17:01,890
真是一个极其聪明的选择
Really fucking smart choice.

342
00:17:02,610 --> 00:17:04,000
因为我是认真的
Uh, I-I meant it.

343
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:06,310
是的 这就是我们喜欢你的原因
Yeah, that's why we love you.

344
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:09,500
所以 你准备好改变你的生活了吗
So you ready for your life to change?

345
00:17:11,710 --> 00:17:13,090
包括沃特公司
Including the jewel

346
00:17:13,110 --> 00:17:14,660
王冠上的珍宝
in Vought's crown,

347
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:16,590
世上迄今为止最强大的
the greatest superhero team

348
00:17:16,590 --> 00:17:18,800
超级英雄联盟
the world's ever seen:

349
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:19,800
