The Seven.

350
00:17:20,140 --> 00:17:22,690
这是我们的职责 也是我们的荣誉
That is our job, our honor.

351
00:17:22,740 --> 00:17:23,800
我们是沃特
We are Vought.

352
00:17:23,940 --> 00:17:26,310
我们成就超级英雄
We make heroes super.

353
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:35,410
我有一个意外惊喜给大家
I have a very exciting surprise for you.

354
00:17:36,500 --> 00:17:38,970
七巨头的一员
Both a member of the Seven,

355
00:17:39,020 --> 00:17:41,620
也是七大洋之主
and lord of the seven seas,

356
00:17:41,630 --> 00:17:44,590
亲自到场 有请深水主
live and in person, the Deep.

357
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:00,800
谢谢
Thank you.

358
00:18:04,410 --> 00:18:05,600
谢谢大家
Thank you, everybody.

359
00:18:06,650 --> 00:18:09,280
在作为七巨头
After a long,

360
00:18:10,470 --> 00:18:12,800
荣耀征战许久之后
distinguished career with the Seven,

361
00:18:14,260 --> 00:18:16,800
我的好朋友点灯侠退休了
my good friend, the Lamplighter, has retired.

362
00:18:19,360 --> 00:18:20,520
让我们向他致以大大的感谢
Let's give him a big "Thank you."

363
00:18:20,530 --> 00:18:21,600
你们觉得如何
What do you say?

364
00:18:22,420 --> 00:18:23,870
谢谢你 点灯侠
Thank you, Lamplighter!

365
00:18:25,650 --> 00:18:26,710
但现在
But now,

366
00:18:28,010 --> 00:18:30,510
我们要展望未来
as we turn towards the future,

367
00:18:31,990 --> 00:18:35,000
我想向你们介绍一位很特别的人
I'd like to introduce someone very special.

368
00:18:35,850 --> 00:18:38,290
我个人已经迫不及待地想和她并肩作战了
And I, for one, can't wait to work with her.

369
00:18:38,730 --> 00:18:41,490
让我们热烈欢迎星光
Please welcome Starlight.

370
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:42,800
上台吧 该你上了
Go. Go. That's you.

371
00:18:54,420 --> 00:18:58,010
女士们 先生们 星光和深水主
Ladies and gentlemen, Starlight and the Deep.

372
00:19:05,660 --> 00:19:06,890
星光 我爱你
I love you, Starlight!

373
